1.Enable 2FA: Turn on Two-Factor Authentication on your college email and LinkedIn.

2.Check the URL: Before entering credentials, ensure the website starts with https:// and the domain name is spelled correctly (e.g., vitbhopal.ac.in, not vit-bhopal-login.com).

3.Strong Passwords: Use a mix of symbols, numbers, and cases. Avoid using your DOB or Name.

4.Verify Links: Hover over links in emails to see the actual destination before clicking.

5.Report Scams: Use the [suspicious link removed] (Helpline: 1930) if you encounter fraud.
